      "string_id": "esc_dinamit_to_volk_another_end_0",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Wolf, are you interested in a dynamite crate?",
      "JA_current": "Wolf, are you interested in a dynamite crate?",
      "JA_new": "ウルフ、ダイナマイトの箱に興味はあるか？",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "esc_dinamit_to_volk_another_end",
          "phrase_id": "0",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_escape.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_escape:esc_dinamit_to_volk_another_end_1#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_escape",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_escape.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1912,
      "string_id": "esc_dinamit_to_volk_another_end_1",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "A dynamite crate?! Were did you happen to find it?",
      "JA_current": "A dynamite crate?! Were did you happen to find it?",
      "JA_new": "ダイナマイトの箱だと！？ いったいどこで見つけた？",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "esc_dinamit_to_volk_another_end",
          "phrase_id": "1",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_escape.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_escape:esc_dinamit_to_volk_another_end_11#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_escape",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_escape.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1915,
      "string_id": "esc_dinamit_to_volk_another_end_11",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "It doesn't matter - no more dynamite crates there anyway. Make it fast: are you interested or aren't you?",
      "JA_current": "It doesn't matter - no more dynamite crates there anyway. Make it fast: are you interested or aren't you?",
      "JA_new": "それはどうでもいい。あそこにはもう箱は残ってない。手短に頼む。買うのか、買わないのか？",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "esc_dinamit_to_volk_another_end",
          "phrase_id": "11",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_escape.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_escape:esc_dinamit_to_volk_another_end_111#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_escape",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_escape.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1918,
      "string_id": "esc_dinamit_to_volk_another_end_111",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "How much do you charge?",
      "JA_current": "How much do you charge?",
      "JA_new": "いくらで売る？",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "esc_dinamit_to_volk_another_end",
          "phrase_id": "111",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_escape.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_escape:esc_dinamit_to_volk_another_end_1111#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_escape",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_escape.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1921,
      "string_id": "esc_dinamit_to_volk_another_end_1111",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "1'000 and the crate is yours.",
      "JA_current": "1'000 and the crate is yours.",
      "JA_new": "1,000ルーブルだ。箱ごと持っていけ。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "esc_dinamit_to_volk_another_end",
          "phrase_id": "1111",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_escape.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_escape:esc_dinamit_to_volk_another_end_1112#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_escape",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_escape.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1936,
      "string_id": "esc_dinamit_to_volk_another_end_1112",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "500? That's ok for me.",
      "JA_current": "500? That's ok for me.",
      "JA_new": "500か？ それでいい。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "esc_dinamit_to_volk_another_end",
          "phrase_id": "1112",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_escape.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_escape:esc_dinamit_to_volk_another_end_11111#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_escape",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_escape.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1924,
      "string_id": "esc_dinamit_to_volk_another_end_11111",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Look, man, aren't you charging a little too much? Be reasonable and think it over. What's more profitable for me: to pay you a \"grand\" and buy the dynamite, or just waste you right now and acquire the crate for the price of a single cartridge?",
      "JA_current": "Look, man, aren't you charging a little too much? Be reasonable and think it over. What's more profitable for me: to pay you a \"grand\" and buy the dynamite, or just waste you right now and acquire the crate for the price of a single cartridge?",
      "JA_new": "なあ、少し高すぎないか？ もう少し考えろ。千ルーブル払ってダイナマイトを買うのと、弾一発分の値段でお前を始末して箱を手に入れるのと、どっちが得だ？",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "esc_dinamit_to_volk_another_end",
          "phrase_id": "11111",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_escape.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_escape:esc_dinamit_to_volk_another_end_11121#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_escape",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_escape.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1939,
      "string_id": "esc_dinamit_to_volk_another_end_11121",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Deal. Here's your money and give me my dynamite.",
      "JA_current": "Deal. Here's your money and give me my dynamite.",
      "JA_new": "取引成立だ。ほら、金だ。ダイナマイトを渡せ。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "esc_dinamit_to_volk_another_end",
          "phrase_id": "11121",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_escape.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_escape:esc_dinamit_to_volk_another_end_111111#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_escape",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_escape.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1927,
      "string_id": "esc_dinamit_to_volk_another_end_111111",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "The second method is more profitable, I guess.",
      "JA_current": "The second method is more profitable, I guess.",
      "JA_new": "後者のほうが儲かるんだろうな。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "esc_dinamit_to_volk_another_end",
          "phrase_id": "111111",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_escape.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_escape:esc_dinamit_to_volk_another_end_111211#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_escape",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_escape.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1942,
      "string_id": "esc_dinamit_to_volk_another_end_111211",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "It was a pleasure to do business with you. See you!",
      "JA_current": "It was a pleasure to do business with you. See you!",
      "JA_new": "取引できてよかった。じゃあな！",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "esc_dinamit_to_volk_another_end",
          "phrase_id": "111211",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_escape.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_escape:esc_dinamit_to_volk_another_end_1111111#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_escape",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_escape.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1930,
      "string_id": "esc_dinamit_to_volk_another_end_1111111",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "That's right! And that's how I think, too. So, let me give you 500 and you hand over the explosives, I think that deal will end up better for you in the long run.",
      "JA_current": "That's right! And that's how I think, too. So, let me give you 500 and you hand over the explosives, I think that deal will end up better for you in the long run.",
      "JA_new": "そうだ、その通りだ。俺も同じことを考えてた。だから500ルーブル払う。爆薬を渡せ。長い目で見れば、そのほうがお前にとっても得だ。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "esc_dinamit_to_volk_another_end",
          "phrase_id": "1111111",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_escape.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_escape:esc_dinamit_to_volk_another_end_11111111#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_escape",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_escape.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 1933,
      "string_id": "esc_dinamit_to_volk_another_end_11111111",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Ok, deal then.",
      "JA_current": "Ok, deal then.",
      "JA_new": "よし、取引成立だ。",
